{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0033_1000_039kon", "source_sha256": "a2ba7275c0d6ba6d3128960df34c84545b3ab66b02e7120af0bf044cbde6bbda", "ja": "この間はお疲れさま、{$P$}。\n日焼けの具合はどう？　もうよくなったかしら。", "zh": "之前的工作辛苦了，{$P$}。\n你的晒伤还好吗？恢复了没？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0033_1001_p", "source_sha256": "757e656343f5e94b45c98e8311bdbc27cc87034f050d0f08ddf15b9ef9e029bb", "ja": "はい、このみさんにもらったローションが効きました。\nすみません、俺の方がお世話になっちゃって……。", "zh": "嗯，木实给我的乳液很有效。\n不好意思，反而让你替我操心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0033_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "b872ca6c93151398b29dc5389bd6d8e08daf53866269b6c4f35532010172bd70", "ja": "いいのいいの、気にしないで。\n日焼け止めを持ち歩くくらい、レディのたしなみよ。", "zh": "没关系没关系，不必在意。\n随身携带防晒乳只是淑女的小习惯罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0033_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "d3b4d3738c0fe24e837d77cf6e29f4a211ee287c5b31fa17eb9f69f6d0d99b11", "ja": "それに、{$P$}は私達のために、\nあんな素敵なお仕事を取ってきてくれたんだもの。", "zh": "而且，{$P$}还替我们\n争取到那么棒的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0033_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "4a2b7b6bff27b5d4688a1f33123431bfc73485783d6d2a5922dc9bba6fefd7b6", "ja": "はぁ……。あの浜辺の夕日、綺麗だったわね……。\n最後の水着撮影での水平線、今でも覚えてるわ。", "zh": "啊……那道海岸边的夕阳真美……\n最后拍泳装照时的海平线，我到现在都还记得。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0033_1005_p", "source_sha256": "648abc93fa2304401e9f3416cfc475cb6188a0d233020fb0b1f16fa7e3ed643c", "ja": "そうですね。俺もこのみさんが波打ち際で\nポーズをとっていたシーンが、目に焼き付いてますよ。", "zh": "就是说啊。木实在海岸边摆姿势的场景，\n也烙印在我眼底了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0033_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "d963397cd8527bdab3c1a2a339c6b20b1c9d43c3c4cbd2fbc812d344aae1f8d7", "ja": "そう、目に、焼き付いて……。\nふふ……っ、ふふ、うふふっ♪", "zh": "是吗，烙印在、眼底……\n呵呵……呵呵，唔呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0033_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e60e84a2806305f4ae312c80c645d9a193d69933fda0b74f789cbab3f363df63", "ja": "どうしたんですか？　このみさん。", "zh": "怎么了吗，木实？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0033_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "5e04338060bc12686c56724a00eba54000c10895ed29f2fa1e6512b6cf261446", "ja": "ううん、なんでもないの。{$P$}、\n今度奢るから、一緒にゴハン行きましょうね♪", "zh": "不，没什么。{$P$}，\n下次我请客，一起去吃饭吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0033_1009_p", "source_sha256": "02a5e468936b2422470335258c1006eff314444c02e14223adc0e6d312c30889", "ja": "（撮影した写真は、かなり好評だった。このみさんも\nあれから調子がいいし……水着グラビア、悪くないな）", "zh": "（那时拍的照片大受好评，而在那之后木实的状态\n也一直很好……拍泳装写真集也是不错呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
